{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "忘", "id": "忘"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "深", "id": "深"}, {"form": "渴", "id": "渴"}, {"form": "登", "id": "登"}], "edges": [{"weight": 4.07753744390572, "source": "害", "target": "渴"}, {"weight": 1.0818051703517284, "source": "害", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "大", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.264126727145683, "source": "大", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.9572739077056285, "source": "大", "target": "恥"}, {"weight": 2.8735646395797834, "source": "大", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "大", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 1.0818051703517284, "source": "渴", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.10097591734000218, "source": "樂", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "樂", "target": "忘"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "樂", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 0.324119468654212, "source": "樂", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "信", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "信", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "志", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "深", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "深", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 3.672072335797555, "source": "小", "t